  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Earth Extremity is second-in-charge of the Eight Extremities. When ringing alarm bell sounds during the Calamity Luck Altar fight, Earth Extremity tells Heaven Extremity they can only awaken the Four Desolation Immortals. Longevity Heaven’s Eight Extremities are eight rank seven Gu Immortals who, with the Four Desolations, hold core authority in the grotto-heaven.",
      "chapters": [
        1238
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_eight_extremities",
        "house_calamity_luck_altar",
        "char_heaven_extremity",
        "fac_four_desolations",
        "fac_longevity_heaven",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Earth Extremity Gan Ni kneels before Immortal Zombie Giant Sun in Luck Suppression Heavenly Palace and presents four rank eight Immortal Gu. She is a female immortal who cultivates earth path and refinement path, with deep refinement path attainment, and Giant Sun calls her Longevity Heaven’s refinement path expert for refining those four rank eight Immortal Gu since the fate war under his orders. She answers that master’s luck path methods made the refinements possible, and that Longevity Heaven’s luck fell greatly for it.",
      "chapters": [
        2151
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "gan-ni-refining",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_immortal_zombie_giant_sun",
        "house_luck_suppression_heavenly_palace",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bing Sai Chuan refuses to disturb their lord, saying the lord is working with Earth Extremity, Black Extremity, and Space Extremity to deduce Limitless Demon Venerable’s plot.",
      "chapters": [
        2156
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "deduction-duty",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bing_sai_chuan",
        "char_sun_ming_lu",
        "char_space_extremity",
        "char_limitless_demon_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Narration lists Earth Extremity Gan Ni among the Eight Extremities Bing Sai Chuan sends from Calamity Luck Altar to attack Book Mountain; they activate ancient battle formation Eight Extremities and their battle strength surges from rank seven toward rank eight elites.",
      "chapters": [
        2182
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "named-among-eight",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_book_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Giant Sun Immortal Venerable takes Huang Jin and Longevity Heaven blood path research, he instructs Earth Extremity Gan Ni to refine Immortal Gu, and they obtain several blood path Immortal Gu including blood battle Immortal Gu. Gan Ni keeps refining blood path Immortal Gu for him, including blood rope Immortal Gu, though she cultivates earth path and refinement path rather than pure refinement path, and rank eight success rates stay low.",
      "chapters": [
        2246
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blood-path-commissions",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    }
  ],
